  32548
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday 11/18 to Monday 11/23 · 6:30 PM nightly\n\nSuds N Ci
 nema in Fort Walton Beach puts The Wizard of Oz back on the big screen for
  six nights to kick off the holidays. It is dinner and a movie: full resta
 urant service comes to your seat during the film\, with local craft beer a
 nd wine on the menu. The theater calls it a classic for audiences of all a
 ges\, and a Classic Ticket is $5.\n\nPrice: from $5\n\nDetails: https://co
 astaleventures.com/events/ev-suds-wizard-of-oz-1118.html
